caption: Mature Eldritch Source
tradition-component: mature-eldritch-source

A Spawn Master may replace Psionic, -10%, plus Super, -10%, on any Spawn trait with Eldritch, -5%, using the Domain Core rule. The character pays the normal character-point difference. This does not remove other limitations or Path modifiers and does not alter the retention-depth limit.
